# Requests against the gateway. Start vLLM and the API first:
#   make up-llm && make run-api
#
# Runs in VS Code (REST Client extension), Visual Studio, and Rider.
# Swap @baseUrl to http://localhost:8000 to hit vLLM directly for comparison — note
# that vLLM has no concept of vouchers, so the Authorization header is ignored there.
#
# Editor HTTP clients may hold a streamed response until it completes, so they show
# that streaming *works* but not that it is *unbuffered*. For timing, use the curl
# method in api_documentation/README.md ("Streaming baseline").
#
# Since Milestone 6, /v1/chat/completions requires a voucher. Run "Issue vouchers"
# below first, copy the `key` from the response into @voucherKey, and the chat requests
# will work. Without it they return 401 with an OpenAI-shaped error body. The key is in
# that response and nowhere else — the database keeps only its hash.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

# Matches Admin:Keys in appsettings.Development.json.
@adminKey = dev-admin-key

# Paste a `key` from the issuance response here.
@voucherKey = paste-an-issued-voucher-key-here

### Issue vouchers (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

{
  "section": "CSCI-101",
  "count": 3,
  "allowance": 100000,
  "expiresAt": "2027-06-30T23:59:59Z"
}

### Non-streaming chat completion
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{voucherKey}}

{
  "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one sentence." }]
}

### Streaming chat completion (SSE chunks ending in [DONE])
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{voucherKey}}

{
  "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one sentence." }],
  "stream": true
}

### Rejected: no voucher (401, OpenAI-shaped error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one sentence." }]
}
